This file lists the third-party dependencies used by Decky Language Tutor and their respective licenses.
All pip packages also include full license files in their .dist-info directories within the plugin-dependencies.tar.gz archive.

Phrase Highlighting dictionary (py_modules/providers/phrases-en-ru.tsv)
License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Russian glosses and ranking data are adapted from the English–Russian WikDict
export 2_2026-06, by Karl Bartel and the Wiktionary contributors via DBnary.
https://www.wikdict.com/page/download
https://download.wikdict.com/dictionaries/sqlite/2_2026-06/en-ru.sqlite3
Idiomatic labels and selected glosses are from English Wiktionary via Kaikki
(October 2026 dump, Wiktextract by Tatu Ylonen).
https://en.wiktionary.org/
https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/tags/93/idiomatic/index.html
English phrasal-verb headwords were also checked against the MIT-licensed
generated-english-phrasal-verbs list by WithEnglishWeCan. No definitions or
examples from that list were copied.
https://github.com/WithEnglishWeCan/generated-english-phrasal-verbs
This extract filters headwords, simplifies the formatting, and edits selected
Russian glosses. The license above applies to the dictionary data.

